' Shared body for render-page (light + dark wrappers include this).
' Colours and background live in the wrappers; structure lives here.
title How a page renders — the §8 resolution algorithm (/dashboard)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
autonumber

actor Browser
participant "BFF\n(VDP client)" as BFF
participant "API\n/api · /views · /.well-known" as API
participant "Template server\n/templates" as TS

Browser -> BFF : GET /dashboard

group First request to this origin — discovery (§13.2)
  BFF -> API : GET /.well-known/vdp
  API --> BFF : trustedTemplateDomains (§10)
  note right of BFF : Resolver is built from the advertised\nallowlist, then cached per origin.
end

BFF -> API : GET /api/dashboard\nAccept: application/hal+json
API --> BFF : 200 + clean data\nLink: <…/views/dashboard.json>; rel="view-descriptor" (§4.1)

note right of BFF : Extract the descriptor from the\ntransport (§4) — here, a reference.

BFF -> API : GET /views/dashboard.json (§5)
API --> BFF : view descriptor — template + slots

loop root template, then each slot depth-first (§8, §3.3)
  BFF -> BFF : URL inside the trusted allowlist? (§10)
  BFF -> TS : GET /templates/… (fetched by URL, cached §5.2)
  TS --> BFF : template source
end

BFF -> BFF : render the composed tree with the API data (§6)
BFF --> Browser : plain HTML — the browser never learns VDP exists
